      "statement": "Async task management preserves a child thread's task identity while checks update stored status and return successful output; the default follow-up strategy interrupts the tracked run with a replacement run on the same thread, cancellation records `cancelled`, and listing refreshes nonterminal tasks with cached-status fallback on lookup failure.",
