      "statement": "Async subagent specifications support `update_strategy=\"enqueue\"`: a follow-up is created on the same child thread without interrupting active work, the latest run is recorded as `pending`, and preceding runs are retained as `superseded_run_ids`; one queued follow-up per task per model turn is enforced to keep state tracking sound.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/deepagents/deepagents/middleware/async_subagents.py#L1062-L1209",
